t":1080,"width":1920,"preference":-1,"id":"44","resolution":"1920x1080"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/SAcpESN_Fk4/maxresdefault.webp","height":1080,"width":1920,"preference":0,"id":"45","resolution":"1920x1080"}],"thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/SAcpESN_Fk4/maxresdefault.webp","description":"They were each other's calm in a storm. \nWatch Tiger & Zoya sway their way through Dil Diyan Gallan \n#YRFnewreleases - https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLCB05E03DA939D484\n► Subscribe Now: https://goo.gl/xs3mrY 🔔 Stay updated!\n\n🎧 Song Credits:\nSong: Dil Diyan Gallan\nSinger: Atif Aslam\nMusic: Vishal and Shekhar\nLyrics: Irshad Kamil\n\nChoreography: Vaibhavi Merchant\n\n🎧 Song Lyrics:\nKachchi Doriyon Doriyon Doriyon Se\nMainu Tu Baandh Le\nPakki Yaariyon Yaariyon Yaariyon Mein\nHunde Na Faasle\nEh Naraazgi Kaagzi Saari Teri\nMere Sohneya Sunn Lai Meri\nDil Diyan Gallan\nKaraange Naal Naal Beh Ke\nAkkh Naal Akkh Nu Mila Ke\nDil Diyan Gallan Haaye\nKaraange Roz Roz Beh Ke\nSachchiyaan Mohabbataan Nibha Ke\nSataaye Mainu Kyon\nDikhaaye Mainu Kyon\nAinvein Jhooti Mooti Russ Ke Russa Ke\nDil Diyan Gallan Haaye\nKaraange Naal Naal Beh Ke\nAkkh Naal Akkh Nu Mila Ke\n\nTainu Lakkhan Ton Chhupa Ke\nRakkhan Akkhan Te Sajaa Ke\nTu Ein Meri Wafa\nRakh Apna Bana Ke\nMain Tere Laiyaan Tere Laiyaan Yaara\nNa Paavin Kade Dooriyaan Haaye\nTainu Lakkhan Ton Chhupa Ke\nRakkhan Akkhan Te Sajaa Ke\nTu Ein Meri Wafa\nRakh Apna Bana Ke\nMain Tere Laiyaan Tere Laiyaan Yaara\nNa Paavin Kade Dooriyaan\n\nMain Jeena Haan Tera\nMain Jeena Haan Tera\nTu Jeena Hai Mera\nDass Laina Ki Nakhra Dikha Ke\nDil Diyan Gallan\nKaraange Naal Naal Beh Ke\nAkkh Naal Akkh Nu Mila Ke\nDil Diyan Gallan\n\nRaataan Kaaliyaan Kaaliyaan Kaaliyaan Ne\nMere Din Saanwale\nMere Haaniyaan Haaniyaan Haaniyaan Je\nLage Tu Na Gale\nMera Aasmaan Mausmaan Di Na Sune\nKoi Khwaab Na Poora Bane\nDil Diyan Gallan\nKaraange Naal Naal Beh Ke\nAkkh Naal Akkh Nu Mila Ke\nPata Hai Mainu Kyon\nChhupa Ke Dekhe Tu\nMere Naam Se Naam Mila Ke\nDil Diyan Gallan\nKaraange Naal Naal Beh Ke\nAkkh Naal Akkh Nu Mila Ke\nDil Diyan Gallan\n\nStay in the filmy loop:\n► Like us on Facebook: Facebook/yrf \n► Follow us on X: x.com/yrf\n► Follow us on Instagram: Instagram/yrf\n► Visit us on: yashrajfilms.com\n\n🎬 Movie Credits:\nMovie: Tiger Zinda Hai\nStarring: Salman Khan and Katrina Kaif\nDirector: Ali Abbas Zafar\nProducer: Aditya Chopra\nMusic: Vishal and Shekhar\nLyrics: Irshad Kamil\nDirector of Photography: Marcin Laskawiec, USC\nRelease Date: 22 December 2017\n\nWatch all videos from the film 'Tiger Zinda Hai': https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ePO5M5DE01I&list=PLcVfz1-_0rj90zt_Q2TjsfVgZPk1_SB0c\n\nSynopsis:\nInspired by real events, Tiger Zinda Hai is a sequel to the blockbuster Ek Tha Tiger, and an espionage action drama that follows a daring rescue mission in Iraq. \n \nWhen a group of Indian and Pakistani nurses are held hostage in Iraq by the militant Abu Usman, Indian intelligence (RAW) tracks down the reclusive agent Tiger 8 years after he fled with former Pakistani intelligence (ISI) agent Zoya. Joining forces in the name of humanity, Tiger and Zoya lead a team of RAW and ISI agents to covertly enter the hospital where the nurses are trapped, and get the nurses to safety before an American airstrike blows up the hospital. \n \nTiger Zinda Hai is an all-out entertainer with gritty action, music and drama.\n\nAbout YRF Spy Universe:\nYRF Spy Universe is a first of its kind cinematic universe of spy thriller films in India. The first film in the universe, \"Ek Tha Tiger\", starring Salman Khan and Katrina Kaif was released in 2012, followed by its sequel \"Tiger Zinda Hai\" in 2017. The third film in the universe, \"War\" was released in 2019 and starred Hrithik Roshan and Tiger Shroff in pivotal roles. \"Pathaan\" was the fourth instalment in the Spy Universe franchise which was released in 2023 starring Shah Rukh Khan, Deepika Padukone and John Abraham. \"Tiger 3\", the fifth instalment in the YRF Spy Universe and the third film in the Tiger series, starring Salman Khan, Katrina Kaif and Emraan Hashmi, released in 2023. \"War 2\", the sixth film in the YRF Spy Universe, starring Hrithik Roshan, NTR and Kiara Advani, directed by Ayan Mukerji, released on 14 August 2025. \"Alpha\", the seventh film in the franchise and Hindi cinema’s first female-led YRF Spy Universe film, starring Alia Bhatt and Sharvari, will release on 17 April 2026.\n\n#yrfspyuniverse #yrfnewreleases #tigerzindahai #yrf #yrf50 #yashraj #yashrajfilms #yrfmovies #yrfmusic #yashchopra #adityachopra #dildiyangallan #salmankhan #katrinakaif #atifaslam #aliabbaszafar #vishalshekhar #irshadkamil\n\n© Yash Raj Films Pvt. Ltd.","channel_id":"UCbTLwN10NoCU4WDzLf1JMOA","channel_url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbTLwN10NoCU4WDzLf1JMOA","duration":185,"view_count":834611676,"average_rating":null,"age_limit":0,"webpage_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SAcpESN_Fk4","categories":["Music"],"tags":["salman khan song","katrina kaif song","dil diyan gallan song","tiger zinda hai songs","atif aslam songs","hindi songs","lagu india","salman khan songs","dil diya galla song","dil diya gallan song","kachi doriya song","vishal shekhar song","tiger zinda hai movie songs","เพลงอินเดีย","tenu lakhan to chupake rakha","atif aslam romantic song","kacchi doriyon doriyon","Tu jeena haan mera","bollywood best romantic song","salman khan hit song","Salkat love song","spy universe song","yrf romantic song"],"playable_in_embed":true,"live_status":"not_live","media_type":"video","release_timestamp":null,"_format_sort_fields":["quality","res","fps","hdr:12","source","vcodec","channels","acodec","lang","proto"],"automatic_captions":{"en":[{"url":"https://manifest.googlevideo.com/api/manifest/hls_timedtext_playlist/expire/1767801683/ei/8y5eaZSzJrzCssUP3NmqiAk/ip/103.47.75.254/id/48072911237f164e/source/youtube/requiressl/yes/dur/184.874/tts_params/caps%3Dasr%26v%3DSAcpESN_Fk4%26lang%3Den%26ip%3D103.47.75